%% Coffee detection state machine (src/core/CoffeeDetector.cpp).
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> IDLE

    IDLE --> DETECTING: light on
    IDLE --> NOTIFIED: light already on at boot<br/>(alertIfLightOnAtBoot = false)

    DETECTING --> IDLE: light off
    DETECTING --> READY: light on for readyConfirmationMs<br/>⇒ CoffeeReady

    READY --> NOTIFIED: alert delivered<br/>(markNotified)

    NOTIFIED --> REARMING: light off

    REARMING --> NOTIFIED: light on again
    REARMING --> IDLE: light off for rearmConfirmationMs<br/>⇒ CoffeeReset

    note right of READY
        Buzzer pattern plays (non-blocking),
        then the notifier is called once.
    end note

    note left of IDLE
        "light on/off" comes from the hysteresis:
        on at ≥ lightOnThreshold,
        off at ≤ lightOffThreshold.
        Invalid readings freeze the machine
        and raise SensorFailure once.
    end note
